CCTPBridgeModuleFactory_CreateDeterministic
├── when the salt is unused
│   ├── it should deploy a new CCTPBridgeModule contract
│   ├── it should deploy to the predicted address
│   ├── it should wire the module to the factory chain config
│   ├── it should register the module in the factory
│   └── it should emit a CCTPBridgeModuleCreated event naming the deployer
├── when the same salt is reused
│   └── it should revert
├── when different salts are used
│   └── it should deploy to different addresses
├── when a different caller uses the same salt
│   └── it should still produce a module with this factory chain config
├── when two factories share a salt with different usdc addresses
│   └── it should deploy to different addresses
└── when fuzzing the salt
    └── it should match the deployed address
